<section class="hero" data-screen-label="Hero">
<div class="container">
<div class="hero__grid">
<div>
<span class="hero__eyebrow">Vertical Solutions · Data Center</span>
<h1 class="hero__title">Data Center Lighting Solutions</h1>
<p class="hero__deck">Data centers require highly efficient, low-heat LED lighting with precise optical control to illuminate server aisles without wasting energy. Continuous linear runs or strategically placed low-bays are ideal. Purpose-Built LED Systems for Mission-Critical Environments. Reliable, energy-efficient lighting engineered for diverse environments within a single facility — from high-density server halls to exterior security perimeters.</p>
<div class="hero__cta-row">
<a class="btn btn--primary" href="mailto:sales@archipelagolighting.com?subject=Lighting%20Inquiry%20%E2%80%94%20Data%20Center%20Solutions&amp;body=Hi%20ALG%20Sales%2C%0A%0AI%27m%20interested%20in%20lighting%20for%20a%20Data%20Center%20project%20and%20would%20like%20to%20discuss%20layout%2C%20specifications%2C%20and%20pricing.%0A%0AProject%20details%3A%0A-%20Facility%20/%20location%3A%0A-%20Approx.%20square%20footage%3A%0A-%20Mounting%20height%20/%20ceiling%20type%3A%0A-%20Target%20timeline%3A%0A%0AThank%20you.">Contact Sales <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
<a target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn--ghost" href="https://workdrive.archipelagolighting.com/external/1d73a8f3258ac0209e44427e7340c4995f24a4607b34596cdb349be98aae80b4">Download Spec Pack</a>
