<div class="callout-dark">
<h4 class="callout-dark__title">Why Controls Matter in Data Centers</h4>
<p class="callout-dark__body">ASHRAE 90.1 mandates occupancy and daylight controls in most data center spaces. ALG's sensorBLE platform delivers wireless, fixture-integrated sensing that reduces energy consumption by 40–60% in intermittently occupied zones like server aisles and mechanical rooms — directly improving your facility's Power Usage Effectiveness (PUE).</p>
